# Handoff & Limitations

Core Files
- Dashboard – Main overview of volunteer count, attendance, and staffing.
- Volunteers – Volunteer details, assignments, and check-in/check-out.
- Locations– Staffing requirements, vacancies, and understaffing calculations.
- Calendar / Comments – Event scheduling and coordination.

Demo & Reset
The application uses demo data to showcase volunteer attendance and staffing. Demo data can be reset to restore the initial state.

Limitations / Mocked Features
- Demo volunteer data instead of real registrations.
- Location assignments are simulated/manual.
- Notifications and authentication may not be fully integrated.
- Backend persistence and multi-user synchronization are limited.

Top 3 Improvements for Real Implementation
1. Add a proper backend and database for persistent, real-time data.
2. Implement secure authentication and role-based access.
3. Integrate GPS-based check-in and real notifications.
